From f82811f819e8494296361a28c71c3ece2b84d64d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Instinct Agent <agent@instinct.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:23:27 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Own-window sheets and Song Info to inline frost containers

- New InlineFrostSheet + InlineFrostDialog: the page-window inline
  counterparts of ModalBottomSheet and Dialog. Scrim tap-outside with
  drag fade, back dismiss, drag-down dismiss past a quarter of the
  sheet with nested-scroll leftover so inner lists keep their scroll,
  IME and navigation-bar insets, the 640dp cap, drag handle, reduced
  animation, traversal group + pane title, and a hiddenBehindSheet
  hook for the covered page. Frost-or-solid via frostedCard.
- Converted: Replay share, browse rename, Listen Together party
  sheets (hazeState threaded from MainActivity), the player overflow
  (hazeState over pages, null inside the player's source-less window),
  and Song Info (inline dialog; haze flows down the new LocalSheetHaze
  from the hosting sheet or held menu, so the player's window keeps
  the solid fill).
- Kept with reason: the NowPlaying host sheet (transparent player
  container, not a fill surface), PlaylistPickerSheet (full-screen,
  nothing behind to blur), the Library sort menu (anchored popup,
  different mechanics).
- LocalSheetHaze provided by InlineFrostSheet, InlineFrostDialog and
  HeldContextMenu so anything opened from inside them frosts against
  the window it actually draws in.
- Roborazzi on/off captures for the inline sheet wrapper.
